["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1377: The Brightest Teen Scientists in New Jersey RIG-I TRIM25 K63 ubiquitination HMGB1 MAVS\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-22-twiv-dna病毒的武器竟瞄准rna探测器-还一箭双雕封锁两条免疫通路/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1122</span></div>\n<h2>DNA病毒的武器竟瞄准RNA探测器，还一箭双雕封锁两条免疫通路</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">腺病毒蛋白7本是DNA结合蛋白，却被发现靠劫持TRIM25来压制RNA免疫探测器RIG-I,顺带可能连DNA探测通路也一起封锁。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">病毒学</span><span class=\"tag\">先天免疫</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"HoP 504 Finders Keepers: Hugo Grotius on Property Rights state of nature Law of Nations right of necessity\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-22-hopwag-财产权不是上帝赐给亚当的-而是人类后来达成的协议/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec115ed691f40c47-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">19:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">History of Philosophy Without Any Gaps</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1122</span></div>\n<h2>财产权不是上帝赐给亚当的，而是人类后来达成的协议</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">格劳秀斯认为自然状态下人只有使用物品的权利，没有占有的权利，所有权是后来人类协议的产物，而不是上帝分给亚当后代的天赋。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自然法</span><span class=\"tag\">财产权</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Neolithic Revolution lootable resources monopolizable weapons caged land hierarchical hunter-gatherers\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-22-ancients-埃及有法老-新几内亚没有-差别不在农业-而在作物能不能被抢/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a5dfaa1c7d6f9660-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1122</span></div>\n<h2>埃及有法老，新几内亚没有：差别不在农业，而在作物能不能被抢</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">新几内亚和埃及几乎同时发明农业，但薯芋类作物长在地下、难以囤积，小麦大麦却能被储存和掠夺——这决定了谁会走向国王与金字塔，谁不会。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">农业起源</span><span class=\"tag\">国家形成</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Since last year, we asked: “What if AI solved the Riemann Hypothesis?” Riemann Hypothesis Lean Move 37\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-22-karpathy-ai若证明黎曼猜想却无人能懂-数学家说这根本不算数/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/69b7098cf2c4d5b7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Andrej Karpathy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1122</span></div>\n<h2>AI若证明黎曼猜想却无人能懂，数学家说这根本不算数</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一场关于「天书证明」的思想实验揭示：证明的价值不在于把真假确定到100%，而在于能否被人理解，这才是数学家真正在乎的东西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">黎曼猜想</span><span class=\"tag\">数学证明</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Episode 257 - The Rhynie Chert Lagerstätte sinter / geyserite mycorrhizal antheridium trigonotarbid\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-22-thecommondesce-苏格兰一块石头冻住了地球最早的陆地生态系统-连精子射出瞬间都保住了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f1123c3476b2c469-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:18:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Common Descent Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1122</span></div>\n<h2>苏格兰一块石头冻住了地球最早的陆地生态系统，连精子射出瞬间都保住了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Rhynie Chert 是一处4亿1千万年前的热泉硅华沉积，植物、真菌、线虫在矿化瞬间被整体封存，连繁殖细胞释放的那一刻都清晰可见。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古植物学</span><span class=\"tag\">真菌共生</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1376: Clinical Update with Dr. Daniel Griffin congenital syphilis Sokova (Zokova) turn wild into mild\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-21-twiv-美国正式失去麻疹消除地位-本土持续传播已成常态/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1121</span></div>\n<h2>美国正式失去麻疹消除地位：本土持续传播已成常态</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">泛美卫生组织确认美国本土麻疹已从「输入性散发」变成「本土持续传播」，每周新增病例超200例，而CDC一度拒绝及时公布死亡数据。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">麻疹</span><span class=\"tag\">疫苗政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"#37 Jacob Haqq-Misra - Future of Humanity, UAPs, Technogenic Gases technosignature Project Janus cooperative sovereignty morphological analysis Galileo Project\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-21-coolworldslab-研究者发现军方uap视频里的神秘飞行物-拍翅频率对上了鸟/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4e1a5a8c3b40b506-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:53:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">CoolWorldsLab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1121</span></div>\n<h2>研究者发现军方UAP视频里的神秘飞行物，拍翅频率对上了鸟</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一段被军方作为UAP公开发布、时速480英里的六个编队飞行物，经逐帧分析显示约每秒7次的翼拍频率，与鸟类拍翅节律一致，速度数字本身也只是地面视差。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">SETI</span><span class=\"tag\">技术征兆</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Skeptics Guide #1115 - Nov 21 2026 regolith HVDC backbone eminent domain vermicompost\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-21-skeptics-美国再度失去麻疹消除资格-现任卫生部长本人在传播反疫苗言论/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cc4dc31b3b84e70d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:35:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Skeptics Guide</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1121</span></div>\n<h2>美国再度失去麻疹消除资格：现任卫生部长本人在传播反疫苗言论</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国在2000年宣布消除麻疹后首次失去这一资格，而主管公共卫生的部长小罗伯特·肯尼迪一边说去打疫苗，一边不断释放「不用强制接种」的政治暗语，系统性瓦解了疫苗接种体系。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公共卫生</span><span class=\"tag\">反疫苗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Unicorns alicorn mille fleurs qilin\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-21-stuffmissed-独角兽传说源于一头被糟糕翻译的驴-从波斯道听途说到欧洲圣物/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">35:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1121</span></div>\n<h2>独角兽传说源于一头被糟糕翻译的驴：从波斯道听途说到欧洲圣物</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">欧洲中世纪独角兽传说几乎全部可以追溯到公元前400年一位希腊医生听二手故事写成的书，而所谓的独角兽角，后来被证实大多是海里的叙角鲸牙。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">神话传说</span><span class=\"tag\">中世纪艺术</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Camilla Cavendish on Why Falling Birth Rates Aren&#x27;t a Feminist Success Story heartache gap low fertility trap 4-2-1 problem relationship escalator situationship\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-21-goodfight-韩国每100人将只有12个孙辈-低生育率是组织问题-不是选择问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1121</span></div>\n<h2>韩国每100人将只有12个孙辈：低生育率是组织问题，不是选择问题</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">低生育率的真正瓶颈不是女性不想要孩子，而是「浪漫饥荒」让异性找不到可靠伴侣，社会传染又让生育看起来比实际更不划算。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人口结构</span><span class=\"tag\">生育率</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Professional Network Built for You and Your AI Agent cosign FDE\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-21-a16z-职场社交网络-cosign-让-ai-智能体替你找该认识的人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">17:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1121</span></div>\n<h2>职场社交网络 Cosign 让 AI 智能体替你找该认识的人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Cosign 把专业网络的信任凭证从简历变成「谁为你背书」，并开放给 AI 智能体每天自动扫描列表、寻找值得连接的人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人才招聘</span><span class=\"tag\">专业社交网络</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How AI Is Forcing China to Reshape Industrial Policy self-recursive improvement / RSI new quality productive forces\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-21-oddlots-北京逼着-ai-公司用华为芯片-哪怕这会让模型慢半拍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">45:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1121</span></div>\n<h2>北京逼着 AI 公司用华为芯片，哪怕这会让模型慢半拍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中国的产业政策逻辑是全栈自研供应链优先于当下追赶 AI 前沿，北京压着公司少买 NVIDIA、多用华为，哪怕因此落后美国几个月甚至更久。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中国产业政策</span><span class=\"tag\">华为</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Spend the Lead on Safety: Biden AI Advisors Ben Buchanan &amp; Tantum Collins on the Fate of the World The Bitter Lesson spend the lead on safety closed-loop recursive self-improvement (RSI) compute overhang Bitter Temptation Mythos\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-21-cogrev-前白宫ai顾问-掐断中国算力不是打压-是为了换时间搞安全/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/289df85bdcb3f219-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:49:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1121</span></div>\n<h2>前白宫AI顾问：掐断中国算力不是打压，是为了换时间搞安全</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">两位前白宫AI顾问称，对华芯片封锁的目的不是遏制崛起，而是用算力优势换取时间解决AI安全问题——但中方在日内瓦谈判的开场回应只有一句「先卖芯片」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美AI竞争</span><span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Stress Physiology (YOUR BODY ON STRESS) with Rajita Sinha HPA axis adaptive stress response (ASR) feed forward interoception\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-21-ologies-你以为喝一杯能减压-其实酒精正在摧毁你感知压力的能力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6714d8dbd3a57d1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Ologies</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1121</span></div>\n<h2>你以为喝一杯能减压，其实酒精正在摧毁你感知压力的能力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">酒精、大麻这类「减压」手段会钝化身体发出的压力信号，导致基线压力升高、需要摄入更多才能感到同样的放松，这是一种自我强化的恶性循环。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">压力生理学</span><span class=\"tag\">皮质醇</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The puzzling story of human sleep cathemerality process S / process C sleep efficiency chronotype Epeme S.H.E.L.L.（shelter, hearth, environmental prep, lux, lookouts）\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-21-manyminds-人类是灵长类里睡得最少的物种-这是进化故意为之的结果/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fe31650eb2d0a117-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">58:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Many Minds</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1121</span></div>\n<h2>人类是灵长类里睡得最少的物种，这是进化故意为之的结果</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">跨文化比较显示，无电力的狩猎采集者睡得更短、睡眠效率更低，却自称睡得很好——真正的差异不在睡眠时长，而在昼夜节律振幅。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">睡眠科学</span><span class=\"tag\">进化人类学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Anthropic Goes Public, Nvidia in Crisis, Markets Tank, Open Source Crackdown? open weight RSI (recursive self-improvement) accretive\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-20-allin-查马斯预言ai只剩十家巨头-从矿产到应用全部通吃/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/83e57018bf31be4d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1120</span></div>\n<h2>查马斯预言AI只剩十家巨头：从矿产到应用全部通吃</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Anthropic两万亿上市当天，查马斯提出未来只会有十家AI巨头从挖矿到应用层垂直整合，不属于这个阵营的现金牛公司将被市场无情抛售。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Anthropic IPO</span><span class=\"tag\">Nvidia</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Adjusting for Credit Risk: Masters In Business with David Eichhorn LDI (Liability-Driven Investing) Portable Alpha Information Ratio Interval Fund PBGC (Pension Benefit Guaranty Corporation)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-20-mastersinbiz-固定收益行业的-阿尔法-剥开信用利差后大多只是贝塔/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1120</span></div>\n<h2>固定收益行业的「阿尔法」，剥开信用利差后大多只是贝塔</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">NISA CEO 说，行业里很多被叫作固定收益阿尔法的超额收益，回归信用市场后会大幅缩水，本质是长期超配信用利差的贝塔，而非真正的技能型收益。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">固定收益</span><span class=\"tag\">私募信贷</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Agentic State agentic flooding MCP server\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-20-chinatalk-政府正被ai智能体洪水淹没-关门加验证码是最糟的应对方式/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2cc67e8c35d3477b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1120</span></div>\n<h2>政府正被AI智能体洪水淹没，关门加验证码是最糟的应对方式</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">当公民用ChatGPT和Claude批量提交FOIA申请、补助申请时，政府本能反应会是加验证码、堵流程，但真正该做的是重设服务，用agent自己接住这波需求。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">GovTech</span><span class=\"tag\">智能体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Fakeovers perp walk mention market sandwich attack fakeover\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-20-moneystuff-多数假收购骗局根本没打算赚钱-只是想体验一把谈并购的快感/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c95a1585c224dc58-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">30:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Money Stuff</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1120</span></div>\n<h2>多数假收购骗局根本没打算赚钱，只是想体验一把谈并购的快感</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一个英国人伪装成美国口音的收购方，骗了CEO一场，股票买了却忘发新闻稿没赚到钱——法官报告说他只是享受扮演另一个角色。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">IPO定价</span><span class=\"tag\">预测市场</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why the Agent Era Needs a New Operating System | DHH Omachi Omicron Foundation vibe code pseudo-anonymous hacker\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-20-a16z-dhh说源代码护城河已经没了-谁还信就是在自欺欺人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1120</span></div>\n<h2>DHH说源代码护城河已经没了：谁还信就是在自欺欺人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">DHH认为Agent让软件开发成本归零，Mac和Windows的鼠标点击式交互天生不适合Agent，而Linux历史上被嫌弃的终端、配置文件、详细报错，恰好是Agent最爱的东西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Linux</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"368: Gut Bacteria and Vaccine Induced Fever MALDI-TOF calprotectin flagellin DOT-MGA essential agreement (EA)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-20-thisweekinmicr-疫苗接种后发烧-根源可能是你肠道里的一种细菌和加工食品/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/eb4df99c03bbbeed-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Microbiology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1120</span></div>\n<h2>疫苗接种后发烧，根源可能是你肠道里的一种细菌和加工食品</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究发现爱吃西式加工食品的人肠道里鞭毛菌 Waltera 更多，鞭毛蛋白引发慢性肠道炎症，这让他们打疫苗后更容易发烧——粪便移植到无菌小鼠身上也能复现这个效应。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">肠道微生物组</span><span class=\"tag\">疫苗反应原性</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jensen’s Not Coming Back, Adventures in Agentic Commerce, Q&amp;A on United, GTA VI, iPhone Duo SKU EUV\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-20-sharptech-黄仁勋的真正罪名不是芯片流入中国-而是公开反对芯片禁令/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7a309a358a363994-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:49:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Sharp Tech</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1120</span></div>\n<h2>黄仁勋的真正罪名不是芯片流入中国，而是公开反对芯片禁令</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英伟达卖给Megaspeed供阿里巴巴用的芯片生意本来完全合法，真正让黄仁勋出局的，是他在芯片禁令问题上和政府对着干、拒绝像银行一样配合执法。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">芯片禁令</span><span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Your Kid Doesn’t Need a “Thing” Yet. The Science of Late Specialization kind learning environment / wicked learning environment match quality paramecium principle\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-20-raisinggh-顶尖运动员小时候很少是最强的-早专项反而是负向指标/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c2fa69281802c1bc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">39:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1120</span></div>\n<h2>顶尖运动员小时候很少是最强的，早专项反而是负向指标</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一项针对近3万名音乐家、科学家、运动员的研究发现，童年最优秀的人几乎从不是成年后最优秀的人，早专项、早排名反而预示着更差的成年表现和更高的受伤率。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育儿</span><span class=\"tag\">青少年体育</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Is the Iran War good for the planet? Strait of Hormuz Strategic Petroleum Reserve petrostates vs electrostates permitting reform\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-20-grayarea-伊朗战争切断霍尔木兹两成石油-油价却没涨到200美元/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ebbc73f24465a9d8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Gray Area</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1120</span></div>\n<h2>伊朗战争切断霍尔木兹两成石油，油价却没涨到200美元</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这场史上最大石油供应中断本该把油价推到200美元，结果靠中国囤货、沙特绕道管线和各国战略储备硬扛了过去，而真正伤到全球经济的是柴油，不是汽油。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">能源政策</span><span class=\"tag\">地缘政治</span>\n</div></div></a>"]